                                "sense_id": "996cd0b1-b089-3640-9714-df3376f032b8",
                                "text": "It was these texts, translated yet again into Latin, which were the source of the reimport of swathes of lost Classical knowledge into Latin Europe in later centuries."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a3bee26a-985c-308a-bcee-fa8c9c083af6",
